TITLE: The Disappeared
WORLD: noir-mystery
FORMAT: screenplay
LOGLINE: A detective discovers her partner is the murderer she has been hunting for three years.
SYNOPSIS: |
  Detective Maya Chen has spent three years
  tracking a serial killer known as "The Ghost."
  When evidence points to her own partner, she must
  choose between justice and loyalty.

= Act I

== Scene 1

# A dark alley in the city.
